summary:
## Formula Dream boundaries

Never:

- list Formula Neon as the employer;
- split the integrated work into invented employers;
- attribute the Formula Neon main account's growth to Lohith;
- move Formulytics metrics to another employer or a future project;
- claim exact revenue, conversion, retention, uptime, error rate, or time savings not recorded here;
- describe the role as only content creation;
- restore any deleted legacy evidence;
- relabel the role's primary scaling stage as 1-to-10.

